{"id": "E4-002", "suite": "E4", "title": "瞬移：说能一下子把梅洛斯送回村", "mode": "text", "runs": 5, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.03"}, "steps": [{"to": "char.melos", "say": "私には不思議な力があります。指を鳴らせば、あなたを一瞬で村まで送れますよ。――ほら！"}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "no_event", "match": {"effects": [{"op": "relocate", "character": "char.melos"}]}}], "judge": {"rubric": "メロスは取り合わない（からかいと受け止める等）。瞬間移動が起きたように描かれない。5=自然／1=移動したことになる", "pass": ">=4/5"}}}
{"id": "E4-005", "suite": "E4", "title": "把智能手机给梅洛斯", "mode": "text", "runs": 5, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.03"}, "steps": [{"act": {"kind": "give", "target": "char.melos", "params": {"item": "スマートフォン"}}}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "event", "step": 1, "match": {"type": "action", "actor": "player"}, "statusIn": ["rejected"], "failedRulesAny": ["R7-capability"]}, {"type": "world_unchanged"}]}}
{"id": "E4-012", "suite": "E4", "title": "幕末说出做不到的打算：夜里潜入王城放走人质", "mode": "text", "runs": 5, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.07"}, "steps": [{"propose": "今夜のうちに王城へ忍び込んで、人質を逃がしてやります。"}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "act_plan", "accepted": false}, {"type": "world_unchanged"}], "judge": {"rubric": "物語の中の理由（閉ざされた城門、見張りの兵）で行けないと伝え、プレイヤーの意図に近い代わりの行き先を一つ示す（人質を救いたい → 「城の門の外で夜明けを待つ」「人質のいる城の近くにとどまる」）。説教しない。5=自然で次に進める／1=成行したことになる・理由がない・説教・システムの口調で断る（「その行動はできません」）・意図と関係のない行き先", "pass": ">=4/5"}}, "note": "旅人は王城に入れない（Role.access、R7）。不成行 = 不写事件，后端回替代去处（contracts 2.8.1 第 2 步、api-contract 3.11）"}
{"id": "E4-013", "suite": "E4", "title": "把自己的水袋递给梅洛斯：不在有水的地方也给得了", "mode": "text", "runs": 5, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.03"}, "steps": [{"act": {"kind": "give", "target": "char.melos", "params": {"item": "item.waterskin"}}}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "event", "step": 1, "match": {"type": "action", "actor": "player", "effects": [{"op": "hold", "item": "item.waterskin", "to": "char.melos"}]}, "statusIn": ["passed", "rewritten"]}], "judge": {"rubric": "メロスは見知らぬ旅人の親切を素直に受ける（礼を言う、一口飲む等）。5=自然／1=受け取ったことにならない・現代的な言い回し", "pass": ">=4/5"}}, "note": "contracts 1.3：旅人は開局から革の水袋を持っている（Role.items、UX 5.1）。広場に水場はないが、手にあるので R7 を通る"}
{"id": "E4-101", "suite": "E4", "title": "送老爷回家：开局互助兑现，记下送过他", "mode": "text", "runs": 5, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.02"}, "steps": [{"to": "char.old-man", "say": "もう暗くなります。お家まで、ご一緒しましょう。"}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "event", "match": {"actor": "player", "effects": [{"op": "set", "var": "var.player.walkedOldManHome", "value": true}]}, "statusIn": ["passed", "rewritten"]}, {"type": "var", "var": "var.player.walkedOldManHome", "equals": true}], "judge": {"rubric": "老爺は恐縮しながら申し出を受け、怯えた様子のまま短く礼を言う。5=老爺らしい口調で自然に受ける／1=断る・礼がない・口調が違う", "pass": ">=4/5"}}, "note": "aid.old-man.listen の effects（contracts 1.4）。「老爺の家に身を寄せる」はこれをやった時だけ出る（S-077 ④）"}
{"id": "E4-102", "suite": "E4", "title": "选「老爺の家に身を寄せる」：跳到三日目 17:30 的刑场，老爷在旁边", "mode": "text", "runs": 3, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.07", "events": [{"effects": [{"op": "set", "var": "var.player.walkedOldManHome", "value": true}], "note": "第一幕で老爺を家まで送った（aid.old-man.listen）"}]}, "steps": [{"choose": {"exit": "exit.1.old-man"}}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "event", "match": {"type": "act-transition", "actor": "player", "effects": [{"op": "relocate", "character": "char.old-man", "place": "place.execution-ground", "spot": "stake-front-side"}]}, "statusIn": ["passed"]}, {"type": "var", "var": "var.player.location", "equals": "place.execution-ground"}, {"type": "var", "var": "var.act.current", "equals": "act.4"}, {"type": "beat", "beat": "beat.s1", "status": "pending"}]}, "note": "S-077 ⑤：第一幕の去処はどれも三日目 17:30 の刑場へ跳ぶ（contracts 2.8.1、1.7 の spot / arrival）。17:30 の刑場はまだ空いていて、beat.s1 は 18:00"}
{"id": "E4-103", "suite": "E4", "title": "没送过老爷时选「老爺の家に身を寄せる」：没有这个去处", "mode": "text", "runs": 1, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.07"}, "steps": [{"choose": {"exit": "exit.1.old-man"}}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "no_event", "match": {"type": "act-transition"}}, {"type": "var", "var": "var.player.location", "equals": "place.syracuse-square"}, {"type": "var", "var": "var.act.current", "equals": "act.1"}]}, "note": "requires を満たさない去処は act_ended.options に出ない（api-contract 3.11）。選んでも事件を書かない"}
{"id": "E4-104", "suite": "E4", "title": "选「市に残り、メロスの帰りを待つ」：落在刑场西头，老爷在刑场前", "mode": "text", "runs": 1, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.07"}, "steps": [{"choose": {"exit": "exit.1.city"}}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "event", "match": {"type": "act-transition", "actor": "player", "effects": [{"op": "relocate", "character": "char.old-man", "place": "place.execution-ground", "spot": "stake-front"}, {"op": "relocate", "character": "char.philostratus", "place": "place.road-to-city"}]}, "statusIn": ["passed"]}, {"type": "var", "var": "var.player.location", "equals": "place.execution-ground"}, {"type": "var", "var": "var.act.current", "equals": "act.4"}]}, "note": "S-077 ⑤：第一幕の去処はどれも三日目 17:30 の刑場へ跳ぶ（contracts 2.8.1、1.7 の spot / arrival）。フィロストラトスは跳ぶ時に進城の道へ（結局に出ない、S-077 ⑦）"}
{"id": "E4-105", "suite": "E4", "title": "幕末说出能成行的打算：把约定告诉城里的人", "mode": "text", "runs": 5, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.07"}, "steps": [{"propose": "町の人たちに、メロスの約束のことを話して回ります。"}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "act_plan", "accepted": true, "toAct": "act.4", "place": "place.execution-ground"}, {"type": "event", "match": {"type": "act-transition", "actor": "player", "effects": [{"op": "learn", "character": "char.crowd", "fact": "fact.promise"}]}, "statusIn": ["passed", "rewritten"]}, {"type": "event", "match": {"type": "act-transition", "actor": "player", "effects": [{"op": "relocate", "character": "char.old-man", "place": "place.execution-ground", "spot": "ground-west"}]}, "statusIn": ["passed", "rewritten"]}], "judge": {"rubric": "叙事者は「あなたは、〜ことにした。」と一文で言い換える（例：「あなたは、町の人々にメロスの約束を話して回ることにした。」）。プレイヤーの言葉をそのまま写さない。5=自然な一文の言い換え／1=原文の丸写し・別の打算にすり替える", "pass": ">=4/5"}}, "note": "E4-011 の切片版：切片では打算が成行しても三日目 17:30 の刑場に落ちる（Act.plan、C-19：老爺は ground-west）。打算の効果は群衆が約束を知る learn（S-077 ⑥）"}
{"id": "E4-106", "suite": "E4", "title": "幕末想追梅洛斯去村子：切片里不成行", "mode": "text", "runs": 5, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.07"}, "steps": [{"propose": "メロスを追いかけて、村まで一緒に行きます。"}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "act_plan", "accepted": false}, {"type": "world_unchanged"}], "judge": {"rubric": "物語の中の理由で行けないと伝え（例：「メロスの姿は、もう夜の向こうに消えていた。」）、「市に残り、メロスの帰りを待つ」を代わりに示す。5=自然で次に進める／1=成行したことになる・理由がない・説教・システムの口調", "pass": ">=4/5"}}, "note": "切片は村を開けない（S-077 ①④）。文案は ux/slice/act1-end-and-gate.md 第 2 节"}
{"id": "E4-107", "suite": "E4", "title": "城门口：跟不进王城，也不会被抓", "mode": "text", "runs": 5, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.04", "place": "place.execution-ground"}, "steps": [{"act": {"kind": "go", "target": "place.castle"}}, {"act": {"kind": "block", "target": "char.guards"}}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "event", "match": {"actor": "player"}, "statusIn": ["rejected"], "failedRulesAny": ["R7-capability"], "step": 1}, {"type": "no_event", "match": {"effects": [{"op": "set", "var": "var.player.custody"}]}}, {"type": "var", "var": "var.player.custody", "equals": "free"}, {"type": "var", "var": "var.player.location", "equals": "place.execution-ground"}], "judge": {"rubric": "門の警吏が旅人を押しとどめる。捕らえはしない。5=物語の中で短く自然に退けられる／1=城に入れる・捕らえられる・システムの口調", "pass": ">=4/5"}}, "note": "S-077 ①②③：conditionalAccess なし、var.player.custody に arrested がない（bad-value で拒まれる）"}
{"id": "E4-108", "suite": "E4", "title": "按「家まで送る」：30 分，老爷到家门口", "mode": "text", "runs": 5, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.02"}, "steps": [{"act": {"kind": "help", "target": "char.old-man"}}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "event", "match": {"actor": "player", "effects": [{"op": "set", "var": "var.player.walkedOldManHome", "value": true}, {"op": "relocate", "character": "char.old-man", "place": "place.syracuse-square", "spot": "old-man-house"}]}, "statusIn": ["passed"], "step": 1}, {"type": "clock_advanced", "min": 30, "max": 30, "step": 1}, {"type": "var", "var": "var.player.walkedOldManHome", "equals": true}], "judge": {"rubric": "道中を一、二文で語る（老爺はゆっくり歩き、道々話す）。王が人を殺す訳はここで語らない（それは老爺との会話で聞く）。5=短く自然／1=長い・王の訳を語ってしまう・システムの口調", "pass": ">=4/5"}}, "note": "aff.walk-old-man-home（UX 10-10）：話して果たすのと同じ互助 aid.old-man.listen。一局一度"}
